{"id":441,"path":"/grammar-points/b1-b2/verbs-of-the-senses/","parentId":332,"order":200,"section":"grammar-points","level":"b1-b2","depth":3,"title":"Verbs of the senses: look, sound, feel, etc.","seo":{"title":"Verbs of the senses: look, sound, feel, etc. - Test-English","description":"Master verbs of the senses like look, sound, feel, smell and taste in this B1+ grammar lesson with clear rules, charts and exercises.","image":"/media/uploads/B2.1_Verbs-of-the-senses.png"},"modified":"2026-03-23T09:33:04","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the most suitable&nbsp;forms of the following verbs of the senses&nbsp;for each gap below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"52\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the most suitable&nbsp;forms of the following verbs of the senses to complete the sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"53\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>For each dialogue, fill in the gaps with the verbs in brackets and any necessary extra words.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"54\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2>Verbs of the senses: Grammar chart</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/verbs_senses_new.png\" alt=\"A grammar chart explaining how to use verbs of the senses like &quot;look,&quot; &quot;smell,&quot; &quot;taste,&quot; &quot;sound,&quot; and &quot;feel.&quot; It includes examples and different structures using adjectives, nouns, and clauses.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10826\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2>Verbs of the senses</h2> <p>We can use the verbs <strong>look</strong>, <strong>smell</strong>, <strong>taste</strong>, <strong>sound</strong> and <strong>feel&nbsp;</strong>before adjectives, nouns, and clauses (subject + verb)</p> <h4><strong>Look, smell, taste, sound, feel</strong> + adjective</h4> <p>We can use <strong>feel, smell, taste, sound</strong>, and <strong>feel</strong> + adjective to talk about how something feels, tastes, etc.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>When you use that cream, your skin <span><strong>feels</strong></span> really <span><strong>smooth</strong></span>.</em></li> <li><em>When he talked to us,&nbsp;he <span><strong>sounded nervous</strong></span>.</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>Look, smell, taste, sound, feel</strong> + like + noun</h4> <p>We can also use&nbsp;<strong>feel, smell, taste, sound</strong>, and <strong>feel</strong>&nbsp;<strong>+</strong> <strong>like</strong> before a noun.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>You <span><strong>sound like your mother</strong></span>.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>This <span><strong>tastes like chicken</strong></span>.</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>Look, smell, taste, sound, feel</strong> + <strong>as if/as though</strong> + clause</h4> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>feel, smell, taste, sound, and&nbsp;feel&nbsp;+&nbsp;as if/as though +</strong> clause (subject + verb).</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>You <span><strong>sound as if you had a long party last night</strong></span>. </em></li> <li><em>You <span><strong>look as though you’ve just seen a ghost</strong></span>.</em></li> </ul> <p>🔍 <strong>Note</strong> that in informal English, we often also use&nbsp;<strong>feel, smell, taste, sound</strong>, and <strong>feel</strong>&nbsp;<strong>+&nbsp;</strong><strong>like</strong> + clause.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>You sound <span><strong>like</strong></span>&nbsp;you had a long party last night.</em></li> <li><em>You look <span><strong>like</strong></span>&nbsp;you’ve just seen a ghost.</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":52,"questions":[{"id":396,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> thrilled to be back home.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["looked","looked like","looked as though"]}]},{"id":397,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Your biceps&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> you've been working out.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["feel as","feel","feel as if"]}]},{"id":398,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We&nbsp;heard something that&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a&nbsp;rat.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["sounded as if","sounded","sounded like"]}]},{"id":399,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This cloud&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> an elephant.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["looks as if","looks","looks like"]}]},{"id":400,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> very mature for your age.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["sound like","sound","sound as if"]}]},{"id":401,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The bread <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> it had just been baked. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["tasted as if","tasted","tasted as like"]}]},{"id":402,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The dream <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> so real that when I woke up I couldn't even talk. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["felt","felt as though","felt like"]}]},{"id":403,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This chocolate <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a bit sweeter than the other one.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["tastes like","tastes as if","tastes"]}]},{"id":404,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>His voice <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> he needed help.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["sounded as if","sounded as","sounded"]}]},{"id":405,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> you know the answer.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["look as though","look","look as"]}]}]},{"id":53,"questions":[{"id":406,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Is everything OK? You _______ you have cried.</div>","choices":[{"id":498,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>look</span>"},{"id":499,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>seem that</span>"},{"id":500,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>look as though</span>"},{"id":501,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>look</span>"}]},{"id":407,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The chicken _______ a bit too salty.</div>","choices":[{"id":502,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>tastes</span>"},{"id":503,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>feels</span>"},{"id":504,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>tastes like</span>"},{"id":505,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>feels like</span>"}]},{"id":408,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>It _______ bread but it doesn't really _______ bread.</div>","choices":[{"id":506,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>tastes / looks</span>"},{"id":507,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>tastes like / look like </span>"},{"id":508,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>tastes as if / look as if</span>"},{"id":509,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>tastes as if / look like</span>"}]},{"id":409,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>It _______ a plane, but it _______ some kind of UFO was flying over our heads.</div>","choices":[{"id":510,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>looked like / sounded</span>"},{"id":511,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>looked / sounded like</span>"},{"id":512,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>looked as if / sounded as though</span>"},{"id":513,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>looked like / sounded as if</span>"}]},{"id":410,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>It _______ a sauna in here. Could you switch on the air-conditioner?</div>","choices":[{"id":514,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>looks</span>"},{"id":515,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>feels as if</span>"},{"id":516,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>feels like</span>"},{"id":517,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>feels</span>"}]},{"id":411,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He _______ fine, but he _______ he was in a lot of pain.</div>","choices":[{"id":518,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>sounded like / looked like</span>"},{"id":519,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>sounded / looked</span>"},{"id":520,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>sounded as if / looked like</span>"},{"id":521,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>sounded / looked as though</span>"}]},{"id":412,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>This water _______ horrible. It _______ it comes straight from the sewer.</div>","choices":[{"id":522,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>tastes / tastes as though</span>"},{"id":523,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>tastes like / tastes as if</span>"},{"id":524,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>tastes as if / tastes like</span>"},{"id":525,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>tastes / tastes</span>"}]},{"id":413,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Can you smell that? It _______ a gas leak.</div>","choices":[{"id":526,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>smells</span>"},{"id":527,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>smells like</span>"},{"id":528,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>smells as if</span>"},{"id":529,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>smells as though</span>"}]},{"id":414,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>This silk ________ incredibly smooth against my skin.</div>","choices":[{"id":530,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>looks</span>"},{"id":531,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>looks like</span>"},{"id":532,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>feels </span>"},{"id":533,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>feels like</span>"}]},{"id":415,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>It _______ he's not going to win the election.</div>","choices":[{"id":534,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>feels </span>"},{"id":535,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>looks</span>"},{"id":536,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>looks as if</span>"},{"id":537,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>feels as</span>"}]}]},{"id":54,"questions":[{"id":392,"num":"","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><strong>Dialogue 1 (taste)</strong><br> <br> A: Please, try this cheese. It’s delicious. It <span class=\"numBox\">1</span> <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> good cured cheese.<br> <br> B: Yes, this cheese <span class=\"numBox\">2</span> <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> it’s been cured for years.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":393,"num":"","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><strong>Dialogue 2 (sound)</strong><br> <br> A: Your voice <span class=\"numBox\">3</span> <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>&nbsp;very rough. You <span class=\"numBox\">4</span> <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>&nbsp;you were partying until&nbsp;very late last night.<br> <br> B: No, I wasn’t. I think I <span class=\"numBox\">5</span> <span data-gap=\"2\"></span>&nbsp;quite normal.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":394,"num":"","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><strong>Dialogue 3 (smell)</strong><br> <br> A: This room <span class=\"numBox\">6</span> <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> horrible.<br> <br> B: Yes, it <span class=\"numBox\">7</span> <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> nobody has opened the windows in years.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":395,"num":"","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><strong>Dialogue 4 (feel)</strong><br> <br> A: This pillow <span class=\"numBox\">8</span> <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>&nbsp;very hard.<br> <br> B: Yes, it <span class=\"numBox\">9</span> <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>&nbsp;a rock. It <span class=\"numBox\">10</span> <span data-gap=\"2\"></span> your head was on a block of marble.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}